  id: storm_speaker
  displayName: Storm Speaker
  description: Sky Island, in a fortress where ancient Kin called the lightning.
    Wields the storm itself.
  tier: 1
  family: 3
  behaviors:
  - "Calls lightning \u2014 strike zones visible 2 seconds in advance."
  - Manipulates wind to push player away from her.
  - "Has 4 'storm anchors' on the arena floor \u2014 break them to disrupt her."
  - Hardest with metal armor (lightning attraction).
  abilities:
  - "Lightning Strike \u2014 telegraphed AOE"
  - "Gale Push \u2014 radial wind shove"
  - "Static Field \u2014 slows and shocks anyone in zone"
  - "Cyclone \u2014 final phase, central tornado covers half the arena"
  dropItemIds:
